$DATUM Synthesis of
3-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-9-octyl-9H-carbazole.
This compound was prepared from 3-bromo-9-octyl-9H-carbazole and
bis(pinacalate)diboron in the presence of KOAc, PdCl2(PPh3)2 and dioxane.
Yield: 76%. 1H NMR (270 MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.60 (s, 1H, Cz-4-H), 8.13 (d, J =
7.6 Hz, 1H, Cz-1-H), 7.92 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 1H, Cz-2-H), 7.38-7.52 (m, 3H,
Cz-5,7,8-H), 7.20-7.31 (m, 1H, Cz-6-H), 4.30 (t, J = 7.3 Hz, 2H,
-N-CH2-), 1.86 (m, 2H, -CH2-), 1.40 (s, 12H, -C(CH3)2-), 1.17-1.35 (m,
10H, -CH2-), 0.86 (t, 3H, J = 7.0 Hz, -CH3).
