$DATUM 2,2,2-Trifluoro-1-(4-(7-(quinolin-3-yl)-2,3,4,5-tetrahydrobenz[f][1,4]oxazepin-4-ylcarbonyl)phenyl)-ethanone
(1). A mixture of 29 (327 mg, 1.00 mmol), quinolin-3-ylboronic acid (200
mg, 1.15 mmol), potassium carbonate (414 mg, 3.0 mmol), and
[1,1'-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocene]dichloropalladium(II) complex with
dichloromethane (94 mg, 0.12 mmol) in DME (5 mL) was heated to 80 °C for
2 h. The reaction mixture was cooled to ambient temperature and
concentrated on a rotary evaporator, and the residue was purified byflash
chromatography (hexanes/ethyl acetate (2:1)). 40 (282 mg, 75%) as a white
solid. MS (EI): m/z for C23H24N2O3, found 377.1 (MH-).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki-Miyaura coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
