$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
cis-3-[4-Amino-5-(8-fluoro-2-phenylquinolin-7-yl)imidazo[5,1-f][1,2,4]triazin-7-yl]-1-methylcyclobutanol
A mixture of
cis-3-(4-amino-5-bromo-imidazo[5,1-f][1,2,4]triazin-7-yl)-1-methyl-cyclobutanol
(1.50 g, 5.30 mmol),
8-fluoro-2-phenyl-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-quinoline
(3.50 g, 10.0 mmol), potassium carbonate (2.10 g, 15.2 mmol) and
1,1’-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocenepalladium(II) dichloride (0.41 g,
0.50 mmol) in degassed dioxane/water (4:1, v/v, 72 mL) was heated at 95
ºC under N2 for 4 h. The reaction mixture was evaporated to dryness and
the residue obtained was heated with water (25 mL x 2) and decanted. The
residual was purified by silica gel chromatography using a gradient (100%
CH2Cl2 → 3% MeOH in CH2Cl2). Product: 1a Yield: 75%
