$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 2. To 2-fluoropyridin-4-ylboronic acid (0.570 g, 4.04 mmol) and
4-bromo-N-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)pyridin-2-amine (0.80 g, 3.11 mmol)
in 25 mL 4:1 dioxane/water was added sodium carbonate (0.989 g, 9.33
mmol) and the suspension was purged with nitrogen. To this was added
PdCl2(dppf)*dcm (0.127 g, 0.156 mmol) and the mixture heated at 80 °C
under nitrogen. After 6 hours reaction mixture was cooled, diluted with
water and extracted with EtOAc two times. The organics were washed with
water, brine, dried and evaporated. The crude product was purified by
chromatography on silica gel, eluted with 50-70% EtOAc/hexanse,
2'-fluoro-N-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)-4,4'-bipyridin-2-amine (0.64 g, 75
% yield) as tan solid. m/z (APCI-pos) M+1 = 274.0.
