$DATUM N-(2,4-Difluorophenyl)-2-methoxy-5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)pyridine-3-sulfonamide
(73) (117 mg, 0.275 mmol), 2-amino-6-iodo-3-phenyl-4(3H)-quinazolinone
(56) (100 mg, 0.275 mmol), PdCl2(dppf)-CH2Cl2 (22.49 mg, 0.028 mmol) were
purged with nitrogen. The mixture was treated with 2 M sodium carbonate
(500 μL, 1.00 mmol) and 1,4-dioxane (2 mL), and nitrogen was bubbled
through the mixture. The mixture was heated at 80°C for 2 h. After the
mixture was cooled, silica gel was added and the volatiles were removed
under reduced pressure. The residue was purified by column chromatography
(DCM/EtOAc).
5-(2-amino-4-oxo-3-phenyl-3,4-dihydroquinazolin-6-yl)-N-(2,4-difluorophenyl)-2-methoxypyridine-3-sulfonamide
(20) (111 mg, 75%). 1H NMR (DMSO-d 6) δ: 10.19 (s, 1H), 8.76 (d, J = 2.3
Hz, 1H), 8.17 (d, J = 2.5 Hz, 1H), 8.02 (d, J = 2.3 Hz, 1H), 7.91 (dd, J
= 8.7, 2.2 Hz, 1H), 7.47-7.69 (m, 4H), 7.29-7.41 (m, 4H), 6.97-7.11 (m,
1H), 6.42 (br s, 2H), 3.97 (s, 3H); LC-MS m/z = 536.4 (M + H)+.
