$DATUM cis-3-[4-Amino-5-(8-fluoro-2-phenylquinolin-7-yl)imidazo[5,1-f][1,2,4]triazin-7-yl]-1-methylcyclobutanol
A mixture of
cis-3-(4-amino-5-bromo-imidazo[5,1-f][1,2,4]triazin-7-yl)-1-methyl-cyclobutanol
(1.50 g, 5.30 mmol),
8-fluoro-2-phenyl-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-2-yl)-quinoline
(3.50 g, 10.0 mmol), potassium carbonate (2.10 g, 15.2 mmol) and
1,1’-bis(diphenylphosphino)ferrocenepalladium(II) dichloride (0.41 g,
0.50 mmol) in degassed dioxane/water (4:1, v/v, 72 mL) was heated at 95
ºC under N2 for 4 h. The reaction mixture was evaporated to dryness and
the residue obtained was heated with water (25 mL x 2) and decanted. The
residual was purified by silica gel chromatography using a gradient (100%
CH2Cl2 → 3% MeOH in CH2Cl2). Yellow solid (Yield: 65%). 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CD3OD) δ 1.49 (s, 3H), 2.52-2.59 (m, 2H), 2.60-2.68 (m, 2H), 3.71 (m,
1H), 7.48-7.58 (m, 3H), 7.73 (dd, J = 8.4, 6.6 Hz, 1H), 7.87-7.91 (m,
2H), 8.17 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H), 8.23-8.27 (m, 2H), 8.49 (dd, J = 8.8, 1.1
Hz, 1H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ 156.2, 155.7, 154.3, 149.5, 145.9,
138.3, 138.2, 137.1, 129.9, 128.9, 128.7, 128.6, 127.3, 126.8, 123.3,
120.6, 119.7, 112.15, 67.8, 42.9, 26.9, 21.1; MS (ES+): m/z 441.01 [MH+];
HPLC: t R = 2.92 min. (OpenLynx, polar_5min); HRMS (ESI): Calcd for
C25H21FN6O[MH+]: 441.1839, Found: 441.1846; mp = 160 ºC.
