$DATUM tert-Butyl
4-((6-Fluoro-5-(4-methyl-6-(methylthio)-1,3,5-triazin-2-yl)pyridin-3-yl)methyl)piperazine-1-carboxylate
(113b). 1,4-Dioxane (15 mL) and H2O (3 mL) were added to a mixture of 68a
(560 mg, 3.19 mmol), 112 (1.03 g, 3.04 mmol), Na2CO3·H2O (805 mg, 7.59
mmol), and Pd(Ph3P)4 (175 mg, 0.15 mmol). The suspension was heated at 80
°C for 16 h and filtered through a short plug of solid Na2SO4, washing
with EtOAc, and the filtrate was concentrated. The residue was purified
by silica gel column chromatography (gradient: 0% → 30% EtOAc/hexanes) to
give 113b. Yield (968 mg, 74%), white solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ
8.57 (d, J = 9.00 Hz, 1H), 8.30 (s, 1H), 3.58 (s, 2H), 3.44 (br s, 4H),
2.66 (s, 3H), 2.64 (s, 3H), 2.43 (d, J = 4.50 Hz, 4H), 1.46 (s, 9H).
