$DATUM 7-(2-Aminopyrimidin-5-yl)-1-[(dicyclopropylmethyl)amino]-5H-pyrido[4,3-b]indole-4-carboxamide
(60). A mixture of
7-chloro-1-[(dicyclopropylmethyl)amino]-5H-pyrido[4,3-b]indole-4-carboxamide
(70 mg, 0.20 mmol),
5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)-pyrimidin-2-ylamine (61
mg, 0.28 mmol), Pd2(dba)3 (18 mg, 0.02 mmol), tricyclohexylphosphine (14
mg, 0.05 mmol), and K3PO4 (1.27 M in water, 0.53 mL, 0.67 mmol) in
dioxane (4 mL) was purged with nitrogen for 5 min, heated to 100 °C for 3
h, cooled to room temperature, and concentrated. The residue was purified
by flash chromatography to afford 60. White solid, yield 60 mg, 0.15
mmol, 74%. LRMS (ESI) calcd for (C23H24N7O) [M + H]+, 414.2, found 414.1.
1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 11.50 (s, 1H), 8.61 (s, 2H), 8.45 (s, 1H),
8.43 (d, J = 8.2 Hz, 1H), 7.92 (s, 1H), 7.83 (brs, 1H), 7.49 (d, J = 8.2
Hz, 1H), 7.18 (brs, 1H), 6.78 (s, 2H), 6.51 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H), 3.63 (q,
J = 8.5 Hz, 1H), 1.38 (m, 2H), 0.51 (m, 2H), 0.36 (m, 6H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of 1-Amino-5H-pyrido[4,3-b]indol-4-carboxamide Inhibitors of
